      "transcript_text": "I, I'd say mild. I get some relief from stopping. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. Yeah, I've also had a slow-healing toe sore, for about a month. With slow-healing toe sore, pretty mild, if I'm being honest. I did have hair loss on my shins at one point, but that's gone now.",
